  "description": "To others, Im Jin-Ha is a superstar. But to attorney Cha Yul-Ri, he’s just a loyal customer at her mom’s book rental shop who exclusively reads books with dragons in them. After Yul-Ri gets fired from her job, Jin-Ha offers her a spot on his agency’s legal team, with her law school senior as her boss! However, Yul-Ri doesn’t know that her new workplace holds an ancient secret. Something... draconic. Could it be that Yul-Ri and Jin-Ha's relationship goes beyond just books?\n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
